-- 0020_multi_tenant_foundation — tenancy foundation (Phase 1 of the multi-tenant
-- transformation; see docs/plans/multi-tenant-phase0-audit-and-plan.md).
--
-- Generated by drizzle-kit from the entities, then HAND-HARDENED: the generated
-- `ADD COLUMN tenant_id ... DEFAULT current_setting('app.tenant_id', true)::uuid
-- NOT NULL` would evaluate the (unset) GUC for existing rows and fail NOT NULL.
-- Safe sequence instead:
--   1. create platform tables            5. guard assertions
--   2. seed the Masa tenant + dev plan   6. SET DEFAULT (GUC) + SET NOT NULL
--   3. add tenant_id columns (nullable)  7. FKs + re-scoped indexes
--   4. backfill every row to Masa        8. ENABLE RLS + tenant_isolation policies
--
-- The whole file runs in one transaction (drizzle migrator): all-or-nothing.
-- Backfill uses a CONSTANT tenant id: pre-0020 the entire database belongs to
-- the one Masa brand, so deriving via parent FKs would add risk, not safety.
-- Masa tenant id must match MASA_TENANT_ID in src/modules/tenants/tenants.constants.ts.
